<section class="legal-page section-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Refund policy</p><h1>Refund policy</h1><p>Refund rules must be set by the business owner before accepting live payments. Until then, Paystack remains in test setup mode and no live payment should be accepted.</p><p>When configured, publish clear eligibility, contact, review, and processing timelines that match the actual service and applicable law.</p></section>
